<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>opening day of four-day Supersport Series, formerly Castle Cup,</p>
<p>cricket matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 220 (J.Commins 81 not out,</p>
<p>H.Ackerman 51; R.Bryson 4-64). Northern Transvaal 95-2.</p>
<p>In Durban: Natal 315-5 (D.Benkenstein 129 not out, M.Bruyns</p>
<p>73, S.Pollock 59 not out).</p>
<p>In Paarl: Boland 268 (L.Ferreira 127; C.English 5-65).</p>
<p>Griqualand West 7-0.</p>
</text>
